# --- Agent files: never publish from this repository ---
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. The GUARD.IAN agent workflows and case data
# belong in the private GUARD-Project repository. Any copy that appears
# here is incidental and must not be committed.
#
# The scam_cases CSVs contain unreviewed automated verdicts that state
# accusations as fact about named third parties. Publishing them would
# create defamation exposure that cannot be undone by a later deletion.
#
# Patterns are duplicated in upper and lower case deliberately: this repo
# is developed on Windows (core.ignorecase=true) but may be cloned or
# built on a case-sensitive filesystem, where a single-case pattern silently
# stops matching.

